    "progressSummary": "COMPLETE: 24 theorems, 0 sorries, 1 axiom (maynard_tao_sieve_eh). EH conditional H≤12 via Maynard-Tao sieve + optimal 5-tuple {0,2,6,8,12}.",
    "builtItems": [
      "eh_conditional_h_le_12: ∀ N, ∃ n ≥ N, primeGap n ≤ 12 — direct from maynard_tao_sieve_eh + {0,2,6,8,12}",
