    ],
    "insights": [
      "EH reduces Maynard-Tao sieve tuple threshold from k≥50 (BV, unconditional) to k≥5 (EH conditional) — a 10× improvement",
      "The 5-tuple {0,2,6,8,12} with diameter 12 is optimal: all 5 even 5-tuples with diameter ≤ 10 are non-admissible (proved in OQ01)",
      "Two admissible 5-tuples of diameter 12 exist: {0,2,6,8,12} and {0,4,6,10,12}",
      "BV and EH share the same level 1/2, but BV is proved for strict θ < 1/2; the knife-edge extension to θ = 1/2 is the open problem",
      "The unconditional-to-EH gap is 246 vs 12 (factor ~20×), tracing back to the tuple size ratio 50/5 = 10"
    ],
